{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37748","headline":"次韵酬张补阙因寒食见寄之什 · 郑谷","name":"次韵酬张补阙因寒食见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳近清明翠缕长，多情右衮不相忘。\n开缄虽覩新篇丽，破鼻须闻冷酒香。\n时态嬾随人上下，花心甘被蝶分张。\n朝稀且莫轻春赏，胜事由来在帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}